      <title>花旗的Kaiser说，这不是特朗普的股权。</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-13/this-isn-t-a-trump-equity-put-citi-s-kaiser-says-video</link>
      <description><![CDATA[“如果有一个特朗普的看法，它与信贷或债券市场相关，”花旗股权交易策略主管Stuart Kaiser说，因为他认为股权“仍然比这里要低得多”。 （来源：彭博）]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-13/this-isn-t-a-trump-equity-put-citi-s-kaiser-says-video</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 23:13:48 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Prabowo政策发生变化后，全球资金暂停印度尼西亚</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/global-funds-hit-pause-on-indonesia-after-prabowo-policy-changes</link>
      <description><![CDATA[印尼总统Prabowo Subianto试图设计经济复兴正在反对一个艰难的事实的尝试：投资者没有购买他销售的愿景。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/global-funds-hit-pause-on-indonesia-after-prabowo-policy-changes</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 23:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>JPM的Michele：更多的钱</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-13/jpm-s-michele-bit-more-of-a-washout-to-go-in-treasuries-video</link>
      <description><![CDATA[摩根大通资产管理公司（JPMorgan Asset Management）的全球固定收入负责人鲍勃·米歇尔（Bob Michele）说，他看到了“完全的职位去杠杆化”，这给国库价格降低了压力，但他觉得市场的价格低于价格低，这里的收益率很高”。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-13/jpm-s-michele-bit-more-of-a-washout-to-go-in-treasuries-video</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 22:44:27 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>在特朗普停止技术关税之后，美国期货上升：市场包装</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</link>
      <description><![CDATA[唐纳德·特朗普总统在一系列消费电子产品上停止进口关税后，美国股票期货上升，尽管表明将在适当的时候宣布特定的关税。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 22:40:41 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普的关税缓刑和美国 - 伊朗会谈后的石油稳定</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-april-14</link>
      <description><![CDATA[由于交易者权衡华盛顿对智能手机和其他电子产品的关税豁免以及美国和伊朗之间的“建设性”周末讨论的影响，石油的滴答速度较低。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-april-14</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 22:36:03 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>日本的股票期货在美国电子关税停顿后攀升</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/japan-s-stock-futures-climb-after-us-electronic-tariffs-paused</link>
      <description><![CDATA[日本的股票期货在美国对某些消费电子产品的征收征收后，股票期货攀升了，一份报告称，亚洲国家正在为本周的关税谈判做准备。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/japan-s-stock-futures-climb-after-us-electronic-tariffs-paused</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 22:29:07 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普警告电子征收后的电子关税</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-13/trump-warns-electronics-tariffs-coming-after-reprieve-video</link>
      <description><![CDATA[总统唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）承诺仍将关税对手机，计算机和受欢迎的消费电子产品申请，称周末豁免是他在重制美国贸易的整体努力中的程序一步。泰勒·肯德尔（Tyler Kendall）在彭博电视台报道。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-13/trump-warns-electronics-tariffs-coming-after-reprieve-video</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 22:27:38 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>当特朗普暂停电子税时，美元目前就找到了支持</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/dollar-finds-support-for-now-as-trump-pauses-electronics-levies</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在美国对受欢迎的消费电子产品暂停关税之后，美元降低了最近的骚扰，尽管唐纳德·特朗普总统限制了对技术领域的豁免，但恢复的限制。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/dollar-finds-support-for-now-as-trump-pauses-electronics-levies</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 21:09:18 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
